    "body": "> I think fixing this issue would also be easier to use starship as a prompt inside a pure nix-shell where the PATH is not defined the same way. I can test that.\r\n\r\nYeah if I have `eval \"$(/home/bbigras/.cargo/bin/starship init bash)\"` in my .bashrc and with `/home/bbigras/.cargo/bin` is in my path, starship wont work in a pure nix-shell because PATH will not  contain `/home/bbigras/.cargo/bin` anymore.",
